WEBVTT

00:02:59.315 --> 00:03:01.763
my reentry into work was far from easy.

00:03:01.787 --> 00:03:03.087
It was very hard.

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:05.485
The biggest challenge

00:03:05.509 --> 00:03:10.574
was having to separate my personal
and professional lives completely.

00:03:11.316 --> 00:03:13.259
You know --

00:03:13.283 --> 00:03:16.863
OK to cry early in the morning,

00:03:16.887 --> 00:03:20.424
but slap a smile on the face
promptly at eight o'clock

00:03:20.448 --> 00:03:24.468
and act as if everything
is the same as before

00:03:24.492 --> 00:03:26.252
until the workday is over.

00:03:26.595 --> 00:03:30.630
Living in two completely different
worlds at the same time,